WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.077 --> 00:00:06.857
Collections are the shelves content sits on, like Masterclasses. Manage them here.

2
00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:16.246
Topics are tags that cut across shelves, so members can browse by subject.

3
00:00:17.836 --> 00:00:19.852
On the course itself, tick its collection.

4
00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:27.465
Then add its topics.

5
00:00:29.023 --> 00:00:32.794
Update, and browsing in the app follows. Watch the access box too.

6
00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:34.965
A collection can bring access with it.
